  newDesc: "Evolution, theory in biology postulating that the various types of plants,
    animals, and other living things on Earth have their origin in other preexisting
    types and that the distinguishable differences are due to modifications in successive
    generations. The theory of evolution is one of the fundamental keystones of modern
    biological theory.  The diversity of the living world is staggering. More than
    2 million existing species of organisms have been named and described; many more
    remain to be discovered\u2014from 10 million to 30 million, according to some
    estimates"
--- !u!1 &1497652825
