  newTitle: 'Title- Mars '
  newAuthor: 'Author - Unkown '
  newDesc: " Mars is believed to have lost its water when it lost its magnetic field
    around 4 billion years ago. Without an atmosphere, there was nothing to prevent
    Mars\u2019 water from evaporating and then being lost to space. This radiation
    also made the existence of life at the surface of Mars unfeasible."
